---
import DocsLayout from '../../../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---

<DocsLayout
  title="Headless / CI Mode — MHA Manager"
  description="Run MHA Manager batches from the command line using the MHAManager commandlet."
  currentSlug="ci-mode"
>

  <div class="doc-header">
    <h1 class="doc-title">Headless / CI Mode</h1>
    <p class="doc-lead">
      The <code>-run=MHAManager</code> commandlet lets you run a full batch from the command line
      without opening the Unreal Editor UI. Feed it a manifest, collect the exit code, and integrate
      into any CI or automated pipeline.
    </p>
  </div>

  <section class="doc-section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Basic syntax</h2>
    <div class="code-block">
      <pre><code>UnrealEditor-Cmd.exe YourProject.uproject ^
  -run=MHAManager ^
  -manifest="C:/path/to/batch.mhajson" ^
  -log</code></pre>
    </div>
    <p class="section-desc">
      On Linux / macOS replace <code>UnrealEditor-Cmd.exe</code> with <code>UnrealEditor-Cmd</code>
      and use forward slashes for the manifest path.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="doc-section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Arguments</h2>
    <div class="field-list">
      <div class="field-row header">
        <span>Argument</span>
        <span>Required</span>
        <span>Description</span>
      </div>
      <div class="field-row">
        <span><code>-manifest="&lt;path&gt;"</code></span>
        <span>Yes</span>
        <span>Absolute filesystem path to the <code>.mhajson</code> manifest to run.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="field-row">
        <span><code>-log</code></span>
        <span>Recommended</span>
        <span>Writes engine and plugin log output to stdout. Required for CI to capture progress and errors.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="field-row">
        <span><code>-logfile="&lt;path&gt;"</code></span>
        <span>No</span>
        <span>Redirect log output to a file instead of (or in addition to) stdout.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="field-row">
        <span><code>-nosplash</code></span>
        <span>No</span>
        <span>Suppresses the engine splash screen. Useful for cleaner CI output.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="field-row">
        <span><code>-nullrhi</code></span>
        <span>No</span>
        <span>Disables the GPU render backend. <strong>Do not use</strong> — the MetaHuman solver requires a real GPU. Included here only to document that it is not compatible.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="doc-section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Exit codes</h2>
    <div class="field-list">
      <div class="field-row header">
        <span>Code</span>
        <span>Meaning</span>
      </div>
      <div class="field-row">
        <span><code class="code-success">0</code></span>
        <span>All jobs completed successfully. Artifacts are written and the manifest is updated.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="field-row">
        <span><code class="code-warn">1</code></span>
        <span>One or more jobs failed or produced partial artifacts. The manifest records which jobs failed — re-run with <strong>Do Not Re-Process Solved Takes</strong> enabled to retry only the failed jobs.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="field-row">
        <span><code class="code-error">2</code></span>
        <span>Startup error — the commandlet could not initialize. Check that the manifest path is correct, required plugins are enabled in the host project, and the engine version matches the plugin build.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="doc-section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Log output</h2>
    <p class="section-desc">
      With <code>-log</code> active, the commandlet emits structured progress lines every 10 seconds:
    </p>
    <div class="code-block">
      <pre><code>[MHAManager] Starting batch — 12 jobs queued
[MHAManager] Job 1/12 "Scene01_Take03" — ProcessPerformance (tracking)... 34%
[MHAManager] Job 1/12 "Scene01_Take03" — ProcessPerformance (fitting)... 78%
[MHAManager] Job 1/12 "Scene01_Take03" — Complete (142s)
[MHAManager] Job 2/12 "Scene01_Take04" — ValidateInput...
...
[MHAManager] Batch complete — 11 succeeded, 1 failed
[MHAManager] Manifest saved: C:/path/to/batch.mhajson</code></pre>
    </div>
    <p class="section-desc">
      Failed jobs log the stage at which they failed and the error message from the solver.
      All output is also written to the engine's default log at
      <code>YourProject/Saved/Logs/UnrealEditor-Cmd.log</code>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="doc-section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Example: GitHub Actions step</h2>
    <div class="code-block">
      <pre><code set:html={[
        '- name: Run MHA Manager batch\n',
        '  run: |\n',
        '    &quot;C:/Epic Games/UE_5.7/Engine/Binaries/Win64/UnrealEditor-Cmd.exe&quot; \\\n',
        '      &quot;$&#123;&#123; github.workspace &#125;&#125;/MyProject.uproject&quot; \\\n',
        '      -run=MHAManager \\\n',
        '      -manifest=&quot;$&#123;&#123; github.workspace &#125;&#125;/Saved/MHAManager/batch.mhajson&quot; \\\n',
        '      -log -nosplash\n',
        '  shell: cmd',
      ].join('')}></code></pre>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="doc-section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Retry failed jobs</h2>
    <p class="section-desc">
      When a batch finishes with exit code <code>1</code>, the manifest on disk contains the
      artifact state for every job. To retry only the failures:
    </p>
    <ol class="numbered-list">
      <li>Open the manifest in the editor (<strong>File → Load Manifest</strong> in the batch panel).</li>
      <li>Enable <strong>Do Not Re-Process Solved Takes</strong> in Global Settings.</li>
      <li>Click <strong>Start Batch</strong> (or re-run the commandlet with the same manifest).</li>
    </ol>
    <p class="section-desc" style="margin-top:12px;">
      Jobs with <code>"State": "Complete"</code> artifacts are skipped. Only failed or partial jobs run.
    </p>
  </section>

  <div class="doc-footer">
    <a href="/marketplace/mha-manager/docs/manifests" class="prev-link">
      <span class="nav-label">Previous</span>
      <span class="nav-title">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M19 12H5M12 5l-7 7 7 7"/></svg>
        Manifest Format
      </span>
    </a>
    <a href="/marketplace/mha-manager/docs/troubleshooting" class="next-link">
      <span class="nav-label">Next</span>
      <span class="nav-title">
        Troubleshooting
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
      </span>
    </a>
  </div>

</DocsLayout>

<style>
  .doc-header { margin-bottom: 40px; }

  .doc-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.4rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .doc-lead {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    max-width: 580px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .doc-lead code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    padding: 1px 5px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .doc-section { margin-bottom: 48px; }

  .section-title {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    padding-bottom: 10px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .section-desc {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }

  .section-desc code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    padding: 1px 5px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .section-desc strong { color: var(--text); font-weight: 500; }

  .code-block {
    background: #0a0a0a;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 20px 24px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .code-block pre { margin: 0; }

  .code-block code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: #c9d1d9;
    line-height: 1.75;
    white-space: pre;
  }

  .field-list {
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .field-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.6fr 0.6fr 2fr;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 11px 16px;
    font-size: 0.825rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    align-items: start;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .field-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

  .field-row.header {
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .field-row code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.775rem;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .field-row strong { color: var(--text); font-weight: 500; }

  .code-success { color: #4ade80 !important; }
  .code-warn    { color: #f0a500 !important; }
  .code-error   { color: #f87171 !important; }

  .numbered-list {
    padding-left: 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .numbered-list li {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    padding-left: 4px;
  }

  .numbered-list li strong { color: var(--text); font-weight: 500; }

  .numbered-list code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    padding: 1px 5px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .doc-footer {
    margin-top: 56px;
    padding-top: 28px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .prev-link, .next-link {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
    min-width: 140px;
  }

  .prev-link { align-items: flex-start; }
  .next-link { align-items: flex-end; }
  .prev-link:hover, .next-link:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }

  .nav-label { font-size: 0.7rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: var(--text-muted); }

  .nav-title {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .field-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 4px; }
    .field-row span:nth-child(2) { display: none; }
    .field-row.header span:nth-child(2) { display: none; }
  }
</style>
